 ## Background
-Originated in the context of efficient light propagation for multiple anisotropic volume scattering [S1, book]. The method was developed to address the high computational cost of accumulating opacity for each interaction along a straight path in volume rendering. It is part of the broader family of Discrete Ordinates Methods for solving the Radiative Transfer Equation.
